@startuml Admin Delete Product - Sequence Diagram

actor Admin
participant "ProductController" as ProductCtrl
participant "Product" as Product
participant "Storage" as Storage
participant "View" as View

== Delete Product ==
Admin -> ProductCtrl: destroy(product)
ProductCtrl -> Storage: delete(product->image)
Storage --> ProductCtrl: image_deleted
ProductCtrl -> Product: delete()
Product --> ProductCtrl: product_deleted
ProductCtrl -> View: redirect to products.index
View --> Admin: show "Product deleted successfully"

@enduml
